OL,3,GNEWSAWomen in town hit poor health
OL,4,Aearlier than average
OL,5,
OL,6,FA study of female health in Luton has
OL,7,Frevealed that women in the town see the
OL,8,Fonset of poor health five years earlier
OL,9,Fthan the national average.
OL,11,FThe Let Women Speak report,
OL,12,Fcommissioned by the Borough Council,
OL,13,Falso found over 70% of women aged 45-64
OL,14,Fhad an at-risk Body Mass Index (BMI)
OL,15,Flevel.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
