OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWomen in town hit poor health
OL,4,Aearlier than average
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuton's director of public health Kelly
OL,7,FO'Neill said: "Women are spinning a lot
OL,8,Fof plates as part of what the
OL,9,Fexpectation of being a woman is, so
OL,10,Fmany have put their own health and
OL,11,Fwell-being secondary to the well-being
OL,12,Fof others.
OL,14,F"That meant they weren't turning up for
OL,15,Fcervical screening, breast screening
OL,16,Fand many things that help them stay
OL,17,Fhealthier for longer."
